(i) instead of the light prescribed in Rule 23(a)(i) or (a)(ii), two masthead lights in
a vertical line;
(ii) sidelights;
(iii) a sternlight. (d) A power-driven vessel to which paragraph (a) or (c) of this Rule applies shall also
